# status-mcp — optional env overrides. NO SECRETS live here.
# Copy to .env only if you need to point at non-default paths (e.g. another
# host). The server/probe read these directly from the environment; there is no
# secret material — `gh` auth is handled by the gh CLI's own keychain/token.

# Override the deploy-log INDEX.md location (default: dstrader-docker's).
# STATUS_MCP_DEPLOY_INDEX=~/dev/dstrader-docker/local/deploy_logs/INDEX.md

# Per-project path overrides. Pattern: STATUS_MCP_<PROJECTKEY_UPPER>_<FIELD>
# STATUS_MCP_DSTRADER_REPO_PATH=~/dev/dstrader
# STATUS_MCP_DSTRADER_DEMOS_DIR=~/dev/dstrader/demos
# STATUS_MCP_FAMILYFUND_REPO_PATH=~/dev/FamilyFund

# --- Auth notes (not env-configured here) ---
# tickets  -> requires `gh` authenticated with the `project` + `repo` scopes:
#               gh auth refresh -s project,read:org
# decisions-> requires `git` on PATH.
# server   -> requires `pip install mcp`.
# validate -> requires `pip install jsonschema`.
